@startuml

state Login
state TeacherDashboard
state StudentDashboard
state QuizCreation
state QuizEditing
state QuizSaving
state PublishedQuiz
state StudentQuizSelection
state QuizAnswer
state QuizSubmission
state QuizResultViewing
state Logout

TeacherDashboard --> QuizCreation : CreateQuizEvent
TeacherDashboard --> QuizEditing : EditQuizEvent
QuizCreation --> QuizSaving : SaveQuizEvent
QuizEditing --> QuizSaving : SaveQuizEvent
QuizSaving --> PublishedQuiz : PublishQuizEvent
StudentDashboard --> StudentQuizSelection : QuizStartEvent
StudentQuizSelection --> QuizAnswer : AnswerEvent
QuizAnswer --> QuizSubmission : SubmitQuizEvent
QuizSubmission --> QuizResultViewing : SubmitQuizEvent
Logout --> * : LogoutEvent

Login -- LoginEvent: UserRegistrationEvent|TeacherContinueEvent|StudentContinueEvent
TeacherDashboard -- TeacherContinueEvent: TeacherContinueEvent
StudentDashboard -- StudentContinueEvent: StudentContinueEvent
PublishedQuiz -- * : QuizStartEvent

@enduml
